Package: proxmint
Type: Package
Title: Client for the 'Proxmint' Free Proxy List
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Priandhika", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "support@proxmint.com"),
    person("Proxmint", role = "cph"))
Description: Fetches proxies from the 'Proxmint' free proxy list
    <https://proxmint.com/free-proxies>, where every entry was checked with a
    real request through it within the last 30 minutes. Filter by protocol,
    country and anonymity, sort by score, latency, uptime or last check, and get
    the result as a data frame or as proxy URLs.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://proxmint.com/free-proxies, https://github.com/proxmint/free-proxy-list
BugReports: https://github.com/proxmint/free-proxy-list/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: jsonlite
Encoding: UTF-8
